  "Subscription revenue, conversion, churn and fleet health — computed live from shop and payment data.": ["Amafaranga y’ifatabuguzi, iyinjiza, igabanuka n’imikorere y’amaduka bibarwa mu makuru ariho.","Revenus d’abonnement, conversion, résiliation et état du parc calculés à partir des données en direct.","Mapato ya usajili, ubadilishaji, wateja wanaoacha na hali ya vifaa huhesabiwa kwa data za moja kwa moja."],
  "Broadcast news, promotions and outage notices to the website, the Android app, or a single shop.": ["Ohereza amakuru, promotions n’imenyesha ry’ibibazo ku rubuga, app cyangwa iduka rimwe.","Diffusez actualités, promotions et avis d’incident sur le site, l’application ou une boutique.","Tuma habari, ofa na taarifa za hitilafu kwenye tovuti, programu au duka moja."],
  "Every admin action — from the web admin center and the in-app master console — recorded with who, what and when.": ["Buri gikorwa cy’ubuyobozi kibikwa hamwe n’uwagikoze n’igihe cyacyo.","Chaque action administrative est enregistrée avec son auteur et son horodatage.","Kila kitendo cha msimamizi kinarekodiwa pamoja na aliyekifanya na muda wake."],
  "New BB3 codes use ECDSA P-256 and verify offline with the Android-pinned public key. Legacy BB2 codes are verified online against their original server-issued record.": ["Kode nshya za BB3 zikoresha ECDSA P-256; iza BB2 zisuzumwa kuri seriveri hakurikijwe inyandiko y’umwimerere.","Les nouveaux codes BB3 utilisent ECDSA P-256; les anciens BB2 sont vérifiés en ligne avec leur enregistrement d’origine.","Misimbo mipya ya BB3 hutumia ECDSA P-256; BB2 za zamani hukaguliwa mtandaoni kwa rekodi yake ya awali."],
  "BeBoss Copilot": ["Umufasha wa BeBoss","Assistant BeBoss","Msaidizi wa BeBoss"],
  "Ask about revenue, shops, payments and devices. Answers use live admin data only.": ["Baza ibyerekeye amafaranga, amaduka, ubwishyu n’ibikoresho. Ibisubizo bishingira ku makuru ariho.","Posez des questions sur les revenus, boutiques, paiements et appareils. Les réponses utilisent les données réelles.","Uliza kuhusu mapato, maduka, malipo na vifaa. Majibu hutumia data halisi pekee."],
  "Paired terminals across all shops • extra-device add-ons": ["Ibikoresho byahujwe mu maduka yose • amafaranga y’ibikoresho by’inyongera","Terminaux associés dans toutes les boutiques • options d’appareils supplémentaires","Vifaa vilivyounganishwa kwenye maduka yote • gharama za vifaa vya ziada"],
  "Publish new Android APKs. The website, QR codes and the app's update check all point to the current release.": ["Shyira hanze APK nshya za Android. Urubuga, QR na app bikoresha verisiyo igezweho.","Publiez de nouveaux APK Android. Le site, les QR codes et la vérification de mise à jour utilisent la version actuelle.","Chapisha APK mpya za Android. Tovuti, QR na ukaguzi wa masasisho hutumia toleo la sasa."],
  "Shop not found": ["Iduka ntiryabonetse","Boutique introuvable","Duka halijapatikana"],
  "Every phone → cloud sync as it happens: shop registrations, devices, staff, branch data, payments and code redemptions.": ["Guhuza kwa telefoni na cloud ako kanya: amaduka, ibikoresho, abakozi, amashami, ubwishyu na kode zikoreshwa.","Synchronisation téléphone-cloud en direct : boutiques, appareils, personnel, succursales, paiements et validations de codes.","Ulandanishi wa simu na wingu moja kwa moja: maduka, vifaa, wafanyakazi, matawi, malipo na matumizi ya misimbo."],
  "Master admins only": ["Abayobozi bakuru gusa","Administrateurs principaux uniquement","Wasimamizi wakuu pekee"],
  "Ask a master admin to manage the team.": ["Saba umuyobozi mukuru gucunga itsinda.","Demandez à un administrateur principal de gérer l’équipe.","Mwombe msimamizi mkuu asimamie timu."],
  "Master admins can do everything. Support members can view all data and handle the inbox, but can't approve payments or change shops.": ["Abayobozi bakuru bashobora gukora byose. Abashinzwe ubufasha bareba amakuru no gucunga inbox ariko ntibemeza ubwishyu cyangwa ngo bahindure amaduka.","Les administrateurs principaux ont tous les droits. Le support peut consulter les données et gérer la boîte de réception, sans approuver les paiements ni modifier les boutiques.","Wasimamizi wakuu wana ruhusa zote. Timu ya usaidizi inaweza kuona data na kushughulikia kikasha, lakini haiwezi kuidhinisha malipo au kubadilisha maduka."],
  "Owners, managers and cashiers synced from every shop. PINs and passwords never leave the phones.": ["Ba nyiri amaduka, abayobozi n’abacuruzi bahujwe n’amaduka yose. PIN n’amagambo y’ibanga biguma muri telefoni.","Propriétaires, responsables et caissiers synchronisés depuis chaque boutique. Les PIN et mots de passe restent sur les téléphones.","Wamiliki, mameneja na wahasibu kutoka kila duka husawazishwa. PIN na nywila haziondoki kwenye simu."],
