  "Upload your signed BeBoss APK above. Until then the website shows a 'coming soon' notice.": ["Ohereza APK ya BeBoss yasinywe hejuru. Kugeza icyo gihe urubuga ruzerekana ko izaza vuba.","Téléversez ci-dessus votre APK BeBoss signé. D’ici là, le site affichera « bientôt disponible ».","Pakia APK ya BeBoss iliyotiwa saini hapo juu. Hadi wakati huo tovuti itaonyesha kuwa inakuja hivi karibuni."],
