  "The copilot reads a fresh summary of shops, payments, codes, devices and sync activity each time you ask.": ["Copilot isoma incamake nshya y'amaduka, ubwishyu, kode, ibikoresho na sync igihe cyose ubajije.","Le copilote consulte un résumé récent des boutiques, paiements, codes, appareils et synchronisations à chaque question.","Copilot husoma muhtasari mpya wa maduka, malipo, misimbo, vifaa na usawazishaji kila unapouliza."],
