  "No branch data synced yet": ["Nta makuru y'ishami arahuzwa", "Aucune donnée d’agence synchronisée", "Bado hakuna data ya tawi iliyosawazishwa"],
  "Insights appear after the shop's phone runs its first internet sync. Sales, stock and debts are read from the phone's signed snapshot.": ["Ibyegeranyo bigaragara nyuma y'uko telefone y'iduka ihuje amakuru bwa mbere ikoresheje interneti. Ibyagurishijwe, ububiko n'amadeni bivanwa mu makuru yasinywe na telefone.", "Les analyses apparaissent après la première synchronisation Internet du téléphone de la boutique. Les ventes, stocks et dettes proviennent de l’instantané signé du téléphone.", "Uchanganuzi huonekana baada ya simu ya duka kusawazisha data kwa mara ya kwanza kupitia intaneti. Mauzo, bidhaa na madeni husomwa kutoka kwenye picha ya data iliyotiwa saini."],
