  "No approved payment, issued code or direct unlock is on record for this owner. Verify before trusting this license.": ["Nta bwishyu bwemejwe, kode yatanzwe cyangwa gufungura byanditswe kuri uyu nyir'iduka. Banza ugenzure mbere yo kwizera uru ruhushya.", "Aucun paiement approuvé, code émis ou déverrouillage direct n’est enregistré pour ce propriétaire. Vérifiez avant de faire confiance à cette licence.", "Hakuna malipo yaliyoidhinishwa, msimbo uliotolewa au kufungua moja kwa moja kulikorekodiwa kwa mmiliki huyu. Hakiki kabla ya kuamini leseni hii."],
  "The app locks on its next sync until you reactivate the shop. Local data stays safe on the device.": ["Porogaramu izafunga ku ihuzwa rikurikira kugeza wongeye gukora iduka. Amakuru yo muri telefone azaguma atekanye.", "L’application se verrouille à la prochaine synchronisation jusqu’à la réactivation de la boutique. Les données locales restent sur l’appareil.", "Programu itafungwa kwenye usawazishaji unaofuata hadi uwashe tena duka. Data ya ndani hubaki salama kwenye kifaa."],
