  "Branch created. It will sync to your phone.": ["Ishami ryakozwe. Rizahuzwa na telefone yawe.", "Agence créée. Elle sera synchronisée avec votre téléphone.", "Tawi limetengenezwa. Litasawazishwa kwenye simu yako."],
  "Branch removed. It will sync to your phone.": ["Ishami ryakuweho. Impinduka zizahuzwa na telefone yawe.", "Agence supprimée. Le changement sera synchronisé avec votre téléphone.", "Tawi limeondolewa. Mabadiliko yatasawazishwa kwenye simu yako."],
  "Stock transfer recorded. It will sync to your phone.": ["Igikorwa cyo kwimura ibicuruzwa cyanditswe. Kizahuzwa na telefone yawe.", "Transfert de stock enregistré. Il sera synchronisé avec votre téléphone.", "Uhamisho wa bidhaa umerekodiwa. Utasawazishwa kwenye simu yako."],
  "Branch name is required.": ["Izina ry'ishami rirakenewe.", "Le nom de l’agence est obligatoire.", "Jina la tawi linahitajika."],
  "Product, both branches and a positive quantity are required.": ["Igicuruzwa, amashami yombi n'umubare urenze zeru birakenewe.", "Le produit, les deux agences et une quantité positive sont obligatoires.", "Bidhaa, matawi yote mawili na kiasi chanya vinahitajika."],
  "Source and destination branches must differ.": ["Amashami aho biva n'aho bijya agomba kuba atandukanye.", "Les agences source et destination doivent être différentes.", "Matawi ya chanzo na lengwa lazima yawe tofauti."],
  "Could not save branch.": ["Ntibyashobotse kubika ishami.", "Impossible d’enregistrer l’agence.", "Imeshindwa kuhifadhi tawi."],
  "Could not delete branch.": ["Ntibyashobotse gusiba ishami.", "Impossible de supprimer l’agence.", "Imeshindwa kufuta tawi."],
  "Could not save transfer.": ["Ntibyashobotse kubika igikorwa cyo kwimura ibicuruzwa.", "Impossible d’enregistrer le transfert.", "Imeshindwa kuhifadhi uhamisho."],
  "Could not confirm transfer.": ["Ntibyashobotse kwemeza igikorwa cyo kwimura ibicuruzwa.", "Impossible de confirmer le transfert.", "Imeshindwa kuthibitisha uhamisho."],
  "Select an active staff account, its assigned branch and a device name.": ["Hitamo konti y'umukozi ukora, ishami ashinzwe n'izina ry'igikoresho.", "Choisissez un compte de personnel actif, son agence attribuée et un nom d’appareil.", "Chagua akaunti ya mfanyakazi hai, tawi alilopewa na jina la kifaa."],
  "Device slot registered in BeBoss Cloud.": ["Umwanya w'igikoresho wanditswe muri BeBoss Cloud.", "Emplacement d’appareil enregistré dans BeBoss Cloud.", "Nafasi ya kifaa imesajiliwa kwenye BeBoss Cloud."],
  "Could not register the POS device.": ["Ntibyashobotse kwandikisha igikoresho cya POS.", "Impossible d’enregistrer l’appareil POS.", "Imeshindwa kusajili kifaa cha POS."],
  "Join code copied. It will not be shown again after this page is refreshed.": ["Kode yo kwinjira yakoporowe. Ntizongera kugaragara umaze kuvugurura uru rupapuro.", "Code de connexion copié. Il ne sera plus affiché après actualisation de cette page.", "Msimbo wa kujiunga umenakiliwa. Hataonyeshwa tena baada ya kupakia upya ukurasa huu."],
