  "Unlock codes are payment-linked": ["Kode zo gufungura zihuzwa n'ubwishyu", "Les codes de déverrouillage sont liés aux paiements", "Misimbo ya kufungua imeunganishwa na malipo"],
  "New BB3 codes are created only after a submitted payment is manually verified in the Payments queue. Each code is bound to that payment request, shop owner and exact plan.": ["Kode nshya za BB3 zikorwa gusa nyuma yo kugenzura intoki ubwishyu bwoherejwe muri Payments queue. Buri kode ihuzwa n'ubusabe bw'ubwishyu, nyir'iduka na gahunda yihariye.", "Les nouveaux codes BB3 sont créés uniquement après vérification manuelle d’un paiement soumis dans la file Paiements. Chaque code est lié à cette demande de paiement, au propriétaire de la boutique et au forfait exact.", "Misimbo mipya ya BB3 hutengenezwa tu baada ya malipo yaliyowasilishwa kuthibitishwa kwa mkono kwenye foleni ya Malipo. Kila msimbo unaunganishwa na ombi la malipo, mmiliki wa duka na mpango husika."],
  "Review payment proofs": ["Suzuma ibimenyetso by'ubwishyu", "Examiner les preuves de paiement", "Kagua uthibitisho wa malipo"],
