  "Customer MTN MoMo / Airtel Money confirmation SMS": ["SMS y'ubwishyu bw'umukiriya bwa MTN MoMo / Airtel Money", "SMS de confirmation MTN MoMo / Airtel Money du client", "SMS ya uthibitisho ya mteja ya MTN MoMo / Airtel Money"],
  "Reject claim": ["Anga ubusabe", "Rejeter la demande", "Kataa ombi"],
  "Review the customer's SMS, then independently confirm the funds in the official provider merchant transaction history or balance before issuing a BB3 code.": ["Suzuma SMS y'umukiriya, hanyuma wigenzurire ko amafaranga yageze kuri konti y'ubucuruzi yemewe mbere yo gutanga kode ya BB3.", "Examinez le SMS du client, puis confirmez vous-même la réception des fonds dans l’historique officiel du compte marchand avant d’émettre un code BB3.", "Kagua SMS ya mteja, kisha uthibitishe mwenyewe kuwa fedha zimepokelewa kwenye akaunti rasmi ya mfanyabiashara kabla ya kutoa msimbo wa BB3."],
  "Customer-submitted confirmation SMS": ["SMS y'ubwishyu yoherejwe n'umukiriya", "SMS de confirmation fourni par le client", "SMS ya uthibitisho iliyowasilishwa na mteja"],
