  "The owner enters a payment-linked code in the app.": ["Nyir'iduka yinjiza muri porogaramu kode ihujwe n'ubwishyu.", "Le propriétaire saisit dans l’application un code lié au paiement.", "Mmiliki huingiza kwenye programu msimbo uliounganishwa na malipo."],
  "Unlock shop in cloud": ["Fungura iduka muri cloud", "Déverrouiller la boutique dans le cloud", "Fungua duka kwenye cloud"],
  "Activate this registered shop immediately after verification; no code is needed.": ["Kora iri duka ryanditswe ako kanya nyuma yo kugenzura ubwishyu; nta kode ikenewe.", "Activez immédiatement cette boutique enregistrée après vérification ; aucun code n’est nécessaire.", "Washa duka hili lililosajiliwa mara tu baada ya uthibitishaji; hakuna msimbo unaohitajika."],
  "I independently confirmed that the exact amount was received by BeBoss in the official provider account. The submitted SMS alone is not proof of settlement.": ["Nemeje ku giti cyanjye ko amafaranga nyayo yageze kuri konti yemewe ya BeBoss. SMS yoherejwe yonyine ntihagije kwemeza ko ubwishyu bwakiriwe.", "J’ai confirmé indépendamment que le montant exact a été reçu sur le compte officiel du fournisseur de BeBoss. Le SMS fourni seul ne prouve pas le règlement.", "Nimethibitisha mwenyewe kuwa kiasi halisi kimepokelewa kwenye akaunti rasmi ya BeBoss. SMS iliyowasilishwa pekee si uthibitisho wa malipo."],
  "Cloud license activated successfully.": ["Uruhushya rwo muri cloud rwakozwe neza.", "Licence cloud activée avec succès.", "Leseni ya cloud imewezeshwa kwa mafanikio."],
  "The shop does not need an unlock code. The owner should connect the Android terminal to the internet and run Sync to receive the new subscription status.": ["Iri duka ntirikenera kode yo gufungura. Nyiraryo agomba guhuza igikoresho cya Android na interneti agakoresha Sync kugira ngo abone imimerere mishya y'ifatabuguzi.", "La boutique n’a pas besoin de code de déverrouillage. Le propriétaire doit connecter le terminal Android à Internet et lancer Sync pour recevoir le nouveau statut d’abonnement.", "Duka halihitaji msimbo wa kufungua. Mmiliki aunganishe kifaa cha Android kwenye intaneti na kuendesha Sync ili kupokea hali mpya ya usajili."],
  "Search shop, @username, phone, payer, payment note…": ["Shakisha iduka, @username, telefone, uwishyuye cyangwa ibisobanuro by'ubwishyu…", "Rechercher une boutique, @username, téléphone, payeur ou note de paiement…", "Tafuta duka, @username, simu, mlipaji au maelezo ya malipo…"],
  "Record what you confirmed in MTN MoMo / Airtel Money merchant history: amount received, sender and time.": ["Andika ibyo wemeje mu mateka y'ubwishyu ya MTN MoMo / Airtel Money: amafaranga yakiriwe, uwayohereje n'igihe.", "Consignez ce que vous avez confirmé dans l’historique marchand MTN MoMo / Airtel Money : montant reçu, expéditeur et heure.", "Rekodi ulichothibitisha kwenye historia ya mfanyabiashara ya MTN MoMo / Airtel Money: kiasi kilichopokelewa, mtumaji na muda."],
  "Extra POS terminal fee (FRw / month)": ["Amafaranga y'inyongera ya POS terminal (FRw / ukwezi)", "Frais supplémentaire de terminal POS (FRw / mois)", "Ada ya ziada ya kifaa cha POS (FRw / mwezi)"],
  "2,000 FRw per additional paired device": ["2,000 FRw kuri buri gikoresho cy'inyongera gihujwe", "2 000 FRw par appareil supplémentaire associé", "FRw 2,000 kwa kila kifaa cha ziada kilichounganishwa"],
  "The primary owner terminal is included. Every additional active POS device is billed at a fixed 2,000 FRw each month.": ["Igikoresho cya mbere cya nyir'iduka kirimo. Buri gikoresho cya POS cy'inyongera gikora cyishyura FRw 2,000 buri kwezi.", "Le terminal principal du propriétaire est inclus. Chaque appareil POS actif supplémentaire est facturé 2 000 FRw par mois.", "Kifaa kikuu cha mmiliki kimejumuishwa. Kila kifaa cha ziada cha POS kinachotumika hutozwa FRw 2,000 kila mwezi."],
  "Put these values in the app's": ["Shyira aya makuru muri porogaramu ya", "Placez ces valeurs dans le fichier de l’application", "Weka thamani hizi kwenye faili ya programu"],
  ".env": [".env", ".env", ".env"],
  "The value built into the app as": ["Agaciro kari muri porogaramu nka", "La valeur intégrée à l’application sous", "Thamani iliyojengwa kwenye programu kama"],
  "With it, every shop's Retail insights tab confirms the phone's branch data was not altered on the way. Insights still work without it.": ["Bifasha buri duka kugenzura ko amakuru y'ishami ava muri telefone atahinduwe. Ibyegeranyo biracyakora nubwo bitariho.", "Cela permet à chaque boutique de vérifier que les données d’agence du téléphone n’ont pas été modifiées en transit. Les analyses fonctionnent aussi sans cela.", "Hii husaidia kila duka kuthibitisha kuwa data ya tawi kutoka kwenye simu haijabadilishwa njiani. Uchanganuzi bado hufanya kazi bila hiyo."],
