  "Snapshots are HMAC-signed and compressed; they are relayed through the cloud and can be inspected only by authorized admin sessions.": ["Amakuru yabitswe asinywa na HMAC kandi agahuzwa. Anyuzwa muri cloud kandi ashobora kugenzurwa gusa n'abayobozi bafite uburenganzira.", "Les instantanés sont signés HMAC et compressés ; ils transitent par le cloud et ne peuvent être inspectés que par des sessions admin autorisées.", "Picha za data husainiwa kwa HMAC na kubanwa; hupitishwa kupitia cloud na zinaweza kukaguliwa tu na vipindi vya wasimamizi walioidhinishwa."],
